<title>ITALY: Italy has global trade surplus in July.</title>
<headline>Italy has global trade surplus in July.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy had a 6.172 trillion lire global trade surplus in July, the Italian Exchange Office said in a statement.</p>
<p> ITALIAN TRADE BALANCE  July 96	June 96	  July 95</p>
<p> Amount (lire)	    +6.172 trln    +4.333 trln   +2.881 trln</p>
<p> Cumulative yr to date +19.908 trln   +13.614 trln  +10.314 trln</p>
<p>Note: The calculation is based on flows through the financial sector on transactions in excess of 20 million lire.</p>
</text>
